00:01:09.497 --> 00:01:10.830
BOB DATTA: Can everyone hear me?

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:11.810
We're good?

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:12.650
Excellent.

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:16.430
So thank you, Ila, for
